{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/995167-legacies-update","id":995167,"title":"Legacies Update?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-10-29T06:07:07-07:00","id":995167,"title":"Legacies Update?","content":"Hey, all! I vaguely recall that at one point, DaveB mentioned posting a handful of semi-official Legacy updates somewhere. Did those ever get posted? (I only ask because I'm starting my 2E campaign, and a couple of my players are interested in eventually joining the Perfected Adepts &amp; Sisterhood of the Blessed, and I think those were 2 of the mentioned Legacies.)<br /> <br /> Thanks!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/518-alieron","name":"Alieron","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-29T06:54:27-07:00","id":995176,"title":"","content":"Afraid not. As with the FAQ, it's one of those things that takes a back seat to the actual paid work like Signs or Scion.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2855-axelgear","name":"Axelgear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2855_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1450"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-29T07:01:04-07:00","id":995177,"title":"","content":"Or just actually paid work like jobs, freelance writing being what it is.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-29T07:05:55-07:00","id":995180,"title":"","content":"I kind of thought so. Just figured I'd ask in case I'd missed it somewhere!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/518-alieron","name":"Alieron","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-29T15:15:36-08:00","id":1009960,"title":"","content":"Not sure where to drop this, so here works I guess? My take on mechanics Stone Scribes in 2e.<br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">Legacy: Stone Scribes</span></span><br /> <br /> <hr /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">\u201cName\u201d - an inscription that embodies everything a person is and has experienced thus far. Finalized at moment of death.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">Death + Optional TIme</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">#1: Soul Marks</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">Death 1, -- Get the True Name of the dead or the present name of the living.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">Learn Health of soul, &amp; 1 soul mark per potency</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">Soul Marks = persistent conditions, Awakened?, A supernatural being? (not what kind), Have they created a soul stone?, Have they been soul-tampered?, If they are possessed?, Are there Gnosis 5+ Legacy attainments? (not what they are)?, Have they eaten or otherwise consumed another soul?, Are they suffering from Paradox Conditions? (not what they are). </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">Optional: Time 1</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">You may know when a soulmark was acquired.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">1 reach - Instant action</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">#2: Death 2 (Speak with Dead)</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">The mage may interview the Final Name in whatever form it is recorded in as if it was a ghost. The name is not capable of performing actions; it is simply a conversational receptacle for information the individual knew at the time of the name being recorded. Language barriers do not apply. May sense Anchors within Sensory Range</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">Optional: time 2</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">The mage may treat the name as if it was the individual for the purposes of post-cogging, by seeing the past editions of the Name and how it evolved.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">Death 3: The Mage may spend an Instant Action and gain 8-again on the next interaction with an Anchor that would've tied to a Name if it were a ghost at the time it was taken down.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">Optional: Time 3</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">The mage may use Anchors from the past iterations of the Name (relative to its time of inscription), not just its present.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">Reach: 1, for Advanced Duration. Non-instant effect</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">#4: Death 4, You can perform a Ritual, at the end of which you Assume the True Name. This gives you all their Anchors ; most notably causing the other halves of that connection to react to you as they would to the owner of the original Name. Your Vice and Virtue, Resonance and Aura, soul marks, etc. become disguised as though they were the original Name\u2019s owner at the time of inscription.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">Optional: time 4</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">You acquire up to your Time dots in skill or merit dots that the original owner of the Name had.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">This effect lasts one scene. Once the ritual is finished casting, the Caster may speak the name of the individual and that is when the power\u2019s effects begin their ticking duration clock. You may only have one ritual mostly completed at a time. You must perform the ritual again after completing it once.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">#5: Death 5</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">You can create a Ghost of any name. This is a ritual cast and lasts a year; it serves you as a loyal servant.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">Optional: time 5</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">You no longer have to Ritual cast any of these attainments.</span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2632,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","user":"Mrmdubois","date":". 11-30-2016, 04:46 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-29T23:52:52-08:00","id":1010078,"title":"","content":"Well, we had Stone Scribes attempts before on forum - you could use for example <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/987669-%E2%80%8B-2e-fan-stone-scribes\">this topic</a>.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-30T01:39:27-08:00","id":1010105,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/995167-legacies-update?p=1010078#post1010078\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, we had Stone Scribes attempts before on forum - you could use for example <a href=\"http://&amp;quot;&#91;url\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/987669-%E2%80%8B-2e-fan-stone-scribes&quot;]this</a> topic[/URL].</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, but I didn't like it, the attainments contradicted each other, repeated each other's effects, did things that didn't actually involve using the Names, and I'm not sure Reach was used properly.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2632,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","user":"Mrmdubois","date":". 11-30-2016, 05:32 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-30T04:18:30-08:00","id":1010144,"title":"","content":"It's still the topic to talk about Stone Scribes fan update - don't need to pollute this where people looks for info about official one.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","t